    "npcKind": "creature",
    "npcNotes": "<p><strong>Movement:</strong> 5 (Sprint 25)</p><p><strong>Aura of Chill.</strong> Living creatures starting their turn within 10 yards must pass a Will test or take –1D on all tests; animals that fail flee.</p><p><strong>Cold Born.</strong> Lives comfortably in extreme cold.</p><p><strong>Sense Life.</strong> Pinpoints living creatures within 10 yards as a Free Action.</p><p><strong>Snow Stride.</strong> Ignores difficult terrain from ice and snow.</p><p><strong>Snow Stealth.</strong> +1D on Stealth in ice or snow, +2D at night there.</p><p><strong>Spawn Wight.</strong> Its victims rise as wights at sunset (1d6 rounds later if slain at night).</p><p><strong>Sunbane.</strong> –1D on all tests in sunlight.</p><p><strong>Vulnerability: Dragonglass.</strong> Dragonglass weapons ignore its AR and deal Athletics+6 damage.</p><p><em>Statistics: Agility 7 (Acrobatics 2B, Balance 2B, Dodge 3B, Quickness 3B), Athletics 4, Awareness 4, Cunning 5, Endurance 4, Fighting 7 (Long Blades 3B), Stealth 5 (Sneak 2B). SIFRP p. 223.</em></p>",
    "source": "SIFRP p. 223"
  },
